#+ Text deviations for American Truck Simulator. Please, use only terms appropriate for USA (i.e. culture specific nuances, not American English).
#@{

#+ Music/radio player
#@{

#+ Hint shown if no music files are found. Also shown as tooltip when hovering over music_player button.

	key[]: "music_player_hint"
	val[]: "將您的音樂檔案放入<color value=@@clr_sel@@>「文件」<color value=@@clr_txt@@>裡的 <color value=@@clr_sel@@>American Truck Simulator/music<color value=@@clr_txt@@> 資料夾中，就能在此處看到歌曲。"

#+ Tooltip shown when hovering over the radio_stream button.

	key[]: "radio_hint"
	val[]: "編輯<color value=@@clr_sel@@>「文件」<color value=@@clr_txt@@>資料夾中、<color value=@@clr_sel@@>《美洲卡車模擬》<color value=@@clr_txt@@>目錄內的 <color value=@@clr_sel@@>live_streams.sii <color value=@@clr_txt@@> 文件以在遊戲內聆聽喜愛的線上電台！"

#+ Hint shown if no online radio streams are defined.

	key[]: "empty_radio_hint"
	val[]: "如需了解如何新增自訂音樂和電台串流，請參考<color value=@@clr_sel@@>「文件」<color value=@@clr_txt@@>資料夾中、<color value=@@clr_sel@@>《美洲卡車模擬》<color value=@@clr_txt@@>目錄內的 <color value=@@clr_sel@@>readme.rtf<color value=@@clr_txt@@> 檔案。"
#@}

